{
  "tema": 5265,
  "slug": "sirvio-repitio",
  "titulo": "Stem-changing -ir verbs (e > i) in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Pedí tacos; el mesero pidió perdón.",
  "foto": "t01.jpg",
  "regla": "In the preterite, -ir verbs with e in the stem (pedir, servir, repetir, sentir, preferir…) change e to i only in él/ella/usted and ellos/ellas/ustedes: pidió, pidieron. Yo, tú and nosotros stay regular: pedí, pediste, pedimos.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Many **-ir** verbs with an **e** in the stem change it to **i** in the preterite, but **only** in the **third persons**: **él / ella / usted** and **ellos / ellas / ustedes**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Yo**, **tú** and **nosotros** are completely regular."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "pedir",
            "servir",
            "sentir"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "pedí",
              "serví",
              "sentí"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "pediste",
              "serviste",
              "sentiste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "pidió",
              "sirvió",
              "sintió"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros / nosotras",
              "pedimos",
              "servimos",
              "sentimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "pidieron",
              "sirvieron",
              "sintieron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Common ones: **pedir**, **servir**, **repetir**, **seguir**, **conseguir**, **vestirse**, **medir**, **competir**, **mentir**, **sentir**, **preferir**, **divertirse**, **sugerir**, **despedirse**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It doesn't matter what they do in the present (**pido** or **siento**): in the preterite they all change **e → i**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Only **-ir** verbs do this. **-ar** and **-er** verbs never change their stem in the preterite: **pensó**, **entendió**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: the change only happens in the forms that end in **-ió** and **-ieron**: **pidió**, **pidieron**. Where you see those endings, look for the **i**."
        }
      ]
    },
